          "plain": "What you bought is a signed record of what this store observed or made, and it is yours to store, quote, publish and hand to a third party. Its report URL is public and stays public: the point of a signed observation is that somebody other than you can check it. The store keeps the right to keep publishing its own corpus; it claims nothing over what you build on top of the artifact."
